# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. A white porcelain gaiwan with its lid slightly ajar, soft steam rising in loose wet brushstrokes, beside a small cup holding amber tea liquor. A simple round sand timer sits to one side on the wooden table, its sand mid-fall. A few loose tea leaves scattered nearby. Monochrome ink with a faint warm amber tint in the liquor only, wet brush washes, generous negative space, calm and contemplative. No text, no lettering.
